### SCENARIO: Overlapping date ranges rejected
### Prerequisites: run 01-seed-balances.http first

### Step 1: Create a request for May 1-10
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-2",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "2026-05-01",
  "endDate": "2026-05-10",
  "days": 7,
  "idempotencyKey": "overlap-001"
}

### Step 2: Try to create another request overlapping May 5-15
# Expected: 422 INVALID_DATE_RANGE — overlaps with existing request
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-2",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "2026-05-05",
  "endDate": "2026-05-15",
  "days": 7,
  "idempotencyKey": "overlap-002"
}
